  ('exam', 2016, 'Língua Inglesa', NULL, 'Q38 Item 4 (TPS 2016): Decide whether the following statements, concerning the grammatical and semantic aspects of text III, are right (C) or wrong (E). | The author of the review blames the problems of Englebert’s book mostly on his search for a single answer for the issues concerning African countries.', '{"a":"Certo","b":"Errado"}'::jsonb, 'a', NULL),
  ('exam', 2016, 'Língua Inglesa', NULL, 'Q39 Item 1 (TPS 2016): The statements below are about the ideas of text III and the vocabulary used in it. Decide whether those statements are right (C) or wrong (E). 1 The author of the review understands the problems of the African continent as a more complex issue. 2 The word “myriad” (R.21) is synonymous with intricate. 3 Englebert’s experience in the eastern Congo is paradigmatic for the elaboration of his thesis. 4 The noun “constraints” (R.6) could be correctly replaced by limitations. ||263_IRBR_DIPL_1F_002_01 | The basic instruments of public diplomacy are hardly new. The United States, for example, has conducted educational and cultural exchange programs for almost', '{"a":"Certo","b":"Errado"}'::jsonb, 'a', NULL),
  ('exam', 2016, 'Língua Inglesa', NULL, 'Q39 Item 2 (TPS 2016): The statements below are about the ideas of text III and the vocabulary used in it. Decide whether those statements are right (C) or wrong (E). 1 The author of the review understands the problems of the African continent as a more complex issue. 2 The word “myriad” (R.21) is synonymous with intricate. 3 Englebert’s experience in the eastern Congo is paradigmatic for the elaboration of his thesis. 4 The noun “constraints” (R.6) could be correctly replaced by limitations. ||263_IRBR_DIPL_1F_002_01 | sixty years. Cultural diplomacy is usually an exercise in deferred gratification, since such exchange programs typically don’t offer immediate or obvious payoffs. Instead, programs 7 such as the Fulbright educational exchanges represent a long-term strategic investment in establishing mutual trust and understanding. Similarly, the US information programs 10 overseas have a long pedigree: the daily Washington File (formerly the Wireless File) began operation in the State', '{"a":"Certo","b":"Errado"}'::jsonb, 'b', NULL),
